      </div>

      <!-- Messages Body -->
      <div id="chat-messages-container" class="flex-1 p-4 overflow-y-auto space-y-3 bg-slate-50">
        <!-- Dynamic chat message bubbles -->
      </div>

      <!-- Quick Approach Chips -->
      <div class="px-3 py-2 bg-white border-t border-slate-100 flex items-center gap-1.5 overflow-x-auto text-[11px] font-medium shrink-0">
        <span class="text-slate-400 shrink-0 font-bold px-1">Balas Cepat:</span>
        <button type="button" class="chat-quick-chip px-2.5 py-1 rounded-full bg-slate-100 hover:bg-slate-200 text-slate-700 border border-slate-200 shrink-0 transition-all">Halo! Kapan kita bisa ketemuan COD?</button>
        <button type="button" class="chat-quick-chip px-2.5 py-1 rounded-full bg-slate-100 hover:bg-slate-200 text-slate-700 border border-slate-200 shrink-0 transition-all">Lokasi penyerahan barang di mana ya?</button>
        <button type="button" class="chat-quick-chip px-2.5 py-1 rounded-full bg-slate-100 hover:bg-slate-200 text-slate-700 border border-slate-200 shrink-0 transition-all">Barang lengkap dus ori & siap COD!</button>
        <button type="button" class="chat-quick-chip px-2.5 py-1 rounded-full bg-slate-100 hover:bg-slate-200 text-slate-700 border border-slate-200 shrink-0 transition-all">Bisa bayar via QRIS atau Tunai</button>
      </div>

      <!-- Input Form -->
      <form id="form-chat-send" class="p-3 bg-white border-t border-slate-200 flex items-center gap-2 shrink-0">
        <input type="text" id="chat-input-message" autocomplete="off" required placeholder="Tulis pesan ke bidder pilihan..." class="flex-1 px-4 py-2.5 rounded-xl bg-slate-100 border border-slate-200 text-slate-900 text-sm focus:border-navy-900 focus:bg-white focus:outline-none transition-all" />
        <button type="submit" class="px-5 py-2.5 rounded-xl bg-navy-900 hover:bg-navy-800 text-white font-bold text-xs shadow-xs flex items-center gap-1.5 shrink-0 transition-all">
          <span>Kirim</span>
          <svg class="w-3.5 h-3.5" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2.5" d="M14 5l7 7m0 0l-7 7m7-7H3"></path></svg>
        </button>
      </form>
    </div>
  </div>

  <!-- Modal: Konfirmasi SOLD -->
  <div id="modal-confirm-sold" class="fixed inset-0 bg-slate-900/70 backdrop-blur-xs z-50 flex items-center justify-center p-4 hidden">
    <div class="bg-white border border-slate-200 rounded-2xl max-w-md w-full p-6 space-y-5 shadow-2xl relative">
      <div class="flex items-center gap-3 text-emerald-600">
        <div class="w-10 h-10 rounded-full bg-emerald-100 flex items-center justify-center font-bold text-xl">
          🏷️
        </div>
        <div>
          <h3 class="font-extrabold text-slate-900 text-lg">Konfirmasi Produk Terjual (SOLD)</h3>
          <p class="text-xs text-slate-500">Tutup proses bidding & perpindahan kepemilikan</p>
        </div>
      </div>
      
      <div class="p-4 rounded-xl bg-slate-50 border border-slate-200 space-y-2 text-xs text-slate-700">
        <p>Apakah Anda yakin transaksi COD dengan <strong id="confirm-sold-buyer-name" class="text-slate-900 font-bold">Pembeli</strong> untuk produk <strong id="confirm-sold-item-title" class="text-slate-900 font-bold">Produk</strong> telah <strong>SELESAI</strong>?</p>
        <div class="pt-2 border-t border-slate-200 flex justify-between font-semibold">
          <span>Harga Transaksi Akhir:</span>
          <span id="confirm-sold-amount" class="text-emerald-700 font-mono font-bold text-sm">Rp 0</span>
        </div>
        <p class="text-[11px] text-slate-500 pt-1">
          • Status produk di Marketplace akan berubah menjadi <strong class="text-rose-600">SOLD</strong>.<br/>
          • Penawaran lain untuk barang ini otomatis menjadi <strong>Outbid</strong>.<br/>
          • Riwayat perpindahan kepemilikan (Provenance) resmi tercatat di sistem.
        </p>
      </div>

      <div class="flex items-center justify-end gap-3 pt-2">
        <button type="button" id="btn-cancel-sold-confirm" onclick="document.getElementById('modal-confirm-sold').classList.add('hidden')" class="px-4 py-2 rounded-xl bg-slate-100 hover:bg-slate-200 text-slate-700 text-xs font-semibold transition-all">
          Batal
        </button>
        <button type="button" id="btn-execute-sold-confirm" onclick="executeMarkSold()" class="px-5 py-2.5 rounded-xl bg-emerald-600 hover:bg-emerald-700 text-white text-xs font-bold shadow-md transition-all flex items-center gap-1.5">
          <span>Ya, Konfirmasi SOLD</span>
        </button>
